# Accessibility

- Visible focus rings (navy or ochre). Never `outline-none` without a replacement.
- Dual CTAs use text labels, not icon-only.
- Mega menu, drawers, and dialogs: keyboard, focus trap, Escape.
- Product images: alt = name + key spec.
- Contrast: Graphite on cream; white on navy. Do not put small Slate text on ochre.
- Honour `prefers-reduced-motion`.
- Forms: labels above fields; phone `type="tel"`; errors associated with inputs.
- Run axe on home, shop, PDP, checkout, and quote submit when those pages exist.
